{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-61485","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-91284","text":"FleetPrompt — Implementation Build Prompt"}]},{"id":"blk-61486","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91285","marks":["bold"],"text":"Version:"},{"id":"spn-91286","text":" 1.0 | "},{"id":"spn-91287","marks":["bold"],"text":"Date:"},{"id":"spn-91288","text":" April 2026 | "},{"id":"spn-91289","marks":["bold"],"text":"Type:"},{"id":"spn-91290","text":" Full Implementation (Phoenix + OTP + Supabase)"}]},{"id":"blk-61487","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-91291","text":"Your Mission"}]},{"id":"blk-61488","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91292","text":"You are building "},{"id":"spn-91293","marks":["bold"],"text":"FleetPrompt"},{"id":"spn-91294","text":" — the open agent marketplace for the [&] Protocol ecosystem. FleetPrompt is the registry where production-ready AI agents are published, discovered, and deployed in one click. Every listed agent carries a versioned manifest, a computed trust score, declared permissions, and a linked SpecPrompt spec."}]},{"id":"blk-61489","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91295","marks":["bold"],"text":"Read `docs/spec/README.md` fully before writing a single line."},{"id":"spn-91296","text":" It is the authoritative spec."}]},{"id":"blk-61490","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91297","text":"FleetPrompt is the "},{"id":"spn-91298","marks":["bold"],"text":"distribution layer"},{"id":"spn-91299","text":" of the dark factory pipeline:"}]},{"id":"blk-61491","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"SpecPrompt (spec in) → Agentelic (build) → OS-008 (enforce) → FleetPrompt (distribute) → RuneFort (observe)"},{"id":"blk-61492","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91300","text":"FleetPrompt is also the "},{"id":"spn-91301","marks":["bold"],"text":"canonical trust broker"},{"id":"spn-91302","text":" of the [&] ecosystem — it aggregates PRISM CL scores, test coverage, usage data, and audit quality into a single trust score."}]},{"id":"blk-61493","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-91303","text":"Target Stack"}]},{"id":"blk-61494","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Language:     Elixir 1.17+ / OTP 27\nFramework:    Phoenix 1.8+ (LiveView for real-time search, PubSub for trust broadcasts)\nDatabase:     PostgreSQL via shared Supabase (fleet.* schema, migration range 030-039)\nSearch:       pg_trgm + ts_vector (no external search infra)\nHot Cache:    ETS (:fp_manifests, :fp_trust_scores, :fp_search_index, :fp_categories)\nAudit:        Broadway pipeline (batched, append-only)\nBackground:   Oban (trust recompute, webhook delivery, search index refresh)\nAuth:         Supabase Auth (shared [&] ecosystem — amp.profiles, amp.workspaces)\nTelemetry:    :telemetry + Prometheus\nDeploy:       Mix release + Docker on Fly.io"},{"id":"blk-61495","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-91304","text":"Repository Structure"}]},{"id":"blk-61496","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91305","text":"Create this structure inside "},{"id":"spn-91306","marks":["code"],"text":"fleetprompt.com/"},{"id":"spn-91307","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-61497","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"fleetprompt.com/\n├── lib/\n│   ├── fleet_prompt/\n│   │   ├── agents/\n│   │   │   └── agent.ex               # FleetPrompt.Agents.Agent schema (fleet.agents)\n│   │   ├── manifests/\n│   │   │   └── manifest.ex            # FleetPrompt.Manifests.Manifest schema (fleet.manifests)\n│   │   ├── publishers/\n│   │   │   └── publisher.ex           # FleetPrompt.Publishers.Publisher schema (fleet.publishers)\n│   │   ├── installs/\n│   │   │   └── install.ex             # FleetPrompt.Installs.Install schema (fleet.installs)\n│   │   ├── trust/\n│   │   │   ├── engine.ex              # FleetPrompt.TrustEngine — 4-signal score computation\n│   │   │   ├── worker.ex              # FleetPrompt.TrustWorker — GenServer per agent\n│   │   │   └── supervisor.ex          # FleetPrompt.TrustSupervisor — DynamicSupervisor\n│   │   ├── registry.ex                # FleetPrompt.Registry — manifest CRUD, version management\n│   │   ├── search/\n│   │   │   ├── index.ex               # FleetPrompt.SearchIndex — pg_trgm + ts_vector management\n│   │   │   └── query.ex               # FleetPrompt.Search — search query builder\n│   │   ├── forks.ex                   # FleetPrompt.Forks — fork-and-customize workflow\n│   │   ├── install_engine.ex          # FleetPrompt.InstallEngine — deploy orchestration\n│   │   ├── audit_writer.ex            # FleetPrompt.AuditWriter — Broadway append-only audit\n│   │   ├── webhook_dispatcher.ex      # FleetPrompt.WebhookDispatcher — Oban async webhooks\n│   │   ├── pipeline_intake.ex         # FleetPrompt.PipelineIntake — dark factory event handler\n│   │   └── mcp/\n│   │       ├── server.ex              # MCP JSON-RPC server (section 11)\n│   │       └── tools.ex               # Tool definitions and handlers\n│   ├── fleet_prompt.ex                # Application entry point\n│   └── fleet_prompt_web/\n│       ├── router.ex                  # Phoenix router\n│       ├── live/\n│       │   ├── search_live.ex         # LiveView — agent search (⌘K)\n│       │   ├── agent_detail_live.ex   # LiveView — agent detail + manifest\n│       │   ├── trust_dashboard_live.ex # LiveView — trust score dashboard\n│       │   └── publisher_live.ex      # LiveView — publisher profile\n│       └── controllers/\n│           ├── api_controller.ex      # REST API for programmatic access\n│           └── webhook_controller.ex  # POST /api/pipeline/intake (CloudEvents)\n├── test/\n│   ├── trust/\n│   │   ├── engine_test.exs\n│   │   └── worker_test.exs\n│   ├── search/\n│   │   ├── index_test.exs\n│   │   └── query_test.exs\n│   ├── pipeline_intake_test.exs\n│   ├── forks_test.exs\n│   └── fixtures/\n│       ├── customer_support_manifest.json\n│       └── consolidation_event.json\n├── mix.exs\n├── Dockerfile\n└── fly.toml"},{"id":"blk-61498","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-91308","text":"Implementation Order"}]},{"id":"blk-61499","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-91309","text":"Phase 1: Core Registry (weeks 1-6)"}]},{"id":"blk-61500","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61502","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91310","marks":["bold"],"text":"Set up Phoenix project"},{"id":"spn-91311","text":" with Ecto, Supabase config, LiveView"}]}],"id":"blk-61501","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61504","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91312","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement Ecto schemas"},{"id":"spn-91313","text":" (sections 3-4)"}]}],"id":"blk-61503","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-61505","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61507","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91314","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Publishers.Publisher"},{"id":"spn-91315","text":" with workspace_id, user_id (Supabase Auth)"}]}],"id":"blk-61506","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61509","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91316","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Agents.Agent"},{"id":"spn-91317","text":" with workspace_id, search_vector"}]}],"id":"blk-61508","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61511","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91318","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Manifests.Manifest"},{"id":"spn-91319","text":" with all fields from section 4.1"}]}],"id":"blk-61510","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61513","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91320","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Installs.Install"},{"id":"spn-91321","text":" with workspace_id"}]}],"id":"blk-61512","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61515","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91322","text":"Audit events schema with workspace_id"}]}],"id":"blk-61514","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-61516","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61518","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91323","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement Registry"},{"id":"spn-91324","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-91325","marks":["code"],"text":"registry.ex"},{"id":"spn-91326","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-61517","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":3},{"id":"blk-61519","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61521","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91327","text":"Manifest CRUD with version immutability"}]}],"id":"blk-61520","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61523","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91328","text":"Version management (semver enforcement)"}]}],"id":"blk-61522","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61525","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91329","text":"Status transitions: draft → published → deprecated → yanked"}]}],"id":"blk-61524","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-61526","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61528","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91330","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement ETS caches"}]}],"id":"blk-61527","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":4},{"id":"blk-61529","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61531","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91331","marks":["code"],"text":":fp_manifests"},{"id":"spn-91332","text":" — agent_id:version → manifest map"}]}],"id":"blk-61530","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61533","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91333","marks":["code"],"text":":fp_trust_scores"},{"id":"spn-91334","text":" — agent_id → {score, computed_at}"}]}],"id":"blk-61532","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61535","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91335","marks":["code"],"text":":fp_search_index"},{"id":"spn-91336","text":" — trigram → [agent_id]"}]}],"id":"blk-61534","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61537","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91337","marks":["code"],"text":":fp_categories"},{"id":"spn-91338","text":" — category_slug → [agent_id]"}]}],"id":"blk-61536","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-61538","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-91339","text":"Phase 2: Trust Engine (weeks 4-8)"}]},{"id":"blk-61539","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61541","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91340","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement TrustEngine"},{"id":"spn-91341","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-91342","marks":["code"],"text":"trust/engine.ex"},{"id":"spn-91343","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-61540","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-61542","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61544","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91344","text":"4 weighted signals: test_coverage (30%), spec_compliance (25%), usage_history (25%), audit_quality (20%)"}]}],"id":"blk-61543","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61546","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91345","marks":["code"],"text":"compute/1"},{"id":"spn-91346","text":" → integer 0-100"}]}],"id":"blk-61545","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61548","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91347","text":"Individual signal computations from section 5.1"}]}],"id":"blk-61547","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-61549","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61551","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91348","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement TrustWorker"},{"id":"spn-91349","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-91350","marks":["code"],"text":"trust/worker.ex"},{"id":"spn-91351","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-61550","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":2},{"id":"blk-61552","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61554","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91352","text":"GenServer per agent"}]}],"id":"blk-61553","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61556","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91353","text":"Computes initial score on publish"}]}],"id":"blk-61555","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61558","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91354","text":"Recomputes on new data (installs, test results, audits)"}]}],"id":"blk-61557","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61560","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91355","text":"Caches in ETS"}]}],"id":"blk-61559","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61562","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91356","text":"Broadcasts via PubSub"}]}],"id":"blk-61561","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61564","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91357","text":"Hibernates after 5 minutes inactivity"}]}],"id":"blk-61563","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-61565","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61567","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91358","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement TrustSupervisor"},{"id":"spn-91359","text":" — DynamicSupervisor managing TrustWorkers"}]}],"id":"blk-61566","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":3},{"id":"blk-61568","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-91360","text":"Phase 3: Search (weeks 6-10)"}]},{"id":"blk-61569","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61571","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91361","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement full-text search"},{"id":"spn-91362","text":" (section 8)"}]}],"id":"blk-61570","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-61572","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61574","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91363","text":"ts_vector generated column on agents (name A, description B, tags C)"}]}],"id":"blk-61573","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61576","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91364","text":"pg_trgm fuzzy matching indexes"}]}],"id":"blk-61575","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61578","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91365","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Search.search/2"},{"id":"spn-91366","text":" with filters: min_trust, category, runtime, limit"}]}],"id":"blk-61577","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61580","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91367","text":"Ranking: ts_rank descending, then trust_score descending"}]}],"id":"blk-61579","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-61581","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-91368","text":"Phase 4: Publish Pipeline (weeks 8-12)"}]},{"id":"blk-61582","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61584","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91369","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement publish flow"},{"id":"spn-91370","text":" (section 6)"}]}],"id":"blk-61583","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-61585","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61587","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91371","text":"Manifest validation → spec validation → duplicate check → trust computation → index update → audit + notify"}]}],"id":"blk-61586","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61589","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91372","text":"Version immutability enforcement"}]}],"id":"blk-61588","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61591","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91373","text":"Yank support (hides from search, preserves record)"}]}],"id":"blk-61590","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-61592","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61594","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91374","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement AuditWriter"},{"id":"spn-91375","text":" — Broadway pipeline for batched audit writes"}]}],"id":"blk-61593","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61596","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91376","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement WebhookDispatcher"},{"id":"spn-91377","text":" — Oban worker for async webhook delivery with retry/backoff"}]}],"id":"blk-61595","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":2},{"id":"blk-61597","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-91378","text":"Phase 5: Install Pipeline (weeks 10-14)"}]},{"id":"blk-61598","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61600","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91379","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement install flow"},{"id":"spn-91380","text":" (section 7)"}]}],"id":"blk-61599","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-61601","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61603","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91381","text":"Permission r